,\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/iSskYDN193CJfTbSpFfscSwZ9Sx.jpg\",\"rating\":7.5,\"year\":2018,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"England, early 18th century. The close relationship between Queen Anne and Sarah Churchill is threatened by the arrival of Sarah's cousin, Abigail Hill, resulting in a bitter rivalry between the two cousins to be the Queen's favourite.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":402897,\"title\":\"The Death of Stalin\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/AqH7q89NxGRDAyRWKqsL3OBtYfV.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/x2FqFdUxRekbNdow3vZdtDqL96z.jpg\",\"rating\":7,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When dictator Joseph Stalin dies, his parasitic cronies square off in a frantic power struggle to become the next Soviet leader. As they bumble, brawl and back-stab their way to the top, the question remains — just who is running the government?\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":792293,\"title\":\"Dumb Money\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/e9u7luSxFKOZgPTB9XHFnPArGdP.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/dTOQaHP4PjDXU2JwDF6UYqGqRT0.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Vlogger Keith Gill sinks his life savings into GameStop stock and posts about it. When social media starts blowing up, so do his life and the lives of everyone following him. As a stock tip becomes a movement, everyone gets rich—until the billionaires fight back, and both sides find their worlds turned upside down.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1235304,\"title\":\"Colours of Time\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hPj1RiuhW72lIfa8UrIncDGSSD0.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/b28RiKlALbdC2Dmnndt93MBt76h.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2025,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"When four distant cousins inherit a 19th-century home in Normandy, they decide to visit and examine their family history. No one has lived there since the 1940s, and the cousins are intrigued by all of the items they find there, little things that help them to understand their ancestor, Adèle Vermillard. Jumping back and forth in time, they meet the mysterious Adèle, whose bohemian lifestyle, and her relationships with the leading artists of the time, changes their lives.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Drama\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":450322,\"title\":\"The Man Who Invented Christmas\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/qRkzRue5rTzB6PESXBJCKqROOXC.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/hm8Gux0946IfeJ1PZwztOo6lVHH.jpg\",\"rating\":6.9,\"year\":2017,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In 1843, despite the fact that Dickens is a successful writer, the failure of his latest book puts his career at a crossroads, until the moment when, struggling with inspiration and confronting reality with his childhood memories, a new character is born in the depths of his troubled mind; an old, lonely, embittered man, so vivid, so human, that a whole world grows around him, a story so inspiring that changed the meaning of Christmas forever.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"History\",\"Comedy\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":6538,\"title\":\"Charlie Wilson's War\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/45FghqcdSYRWK7PsHUInaFPNd8l.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7k6VuqGQsAgxJBtnLiGOTtkznRU.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2007,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A Texas congressman sets a series of events in motion when he conspires with a CIA operative to aid Afghan mujahideen rebels fighting the Soviets.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1016084,\"title\":\"BlackBerry\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/nQSvHZDuMlrZdm7ooMo8gb4CXhW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cUHxmWfkp6se0Rt10Kr86bMCYDE.jpg\",\"rating\":7.2,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Two mismatched entrepreneurs – egghead innovator Mike Lazaridis and cut-throat businessman Jim Balsillie – joined forces in an endeavour that was to become a worldwide hit in little more than a decade. The story of the meteoric rise and catastrophic demise of the world's first smartphone.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":754609,\"title\":\"Mrs. Harris Goes to Paris\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/eUg0HDLhTEDcXGBU2iK6QRBILv4.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/AhkirfgU32n0D1uxpaGYJEKy2Hu.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2022,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"A 1950s London cleaning lady falls in love with an haute couture dress by Christian Dior and decides to gamble everything for the sake of this folly.\",\"genres\":[\"Drama\",\"Comedy\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":140823,\"title\":\"Saving Mr. Banks\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4RkcUe5PKnYvrCwMjk8giUAoID7.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/7jyGyVB72hHPLjPQu4hqDGCaraK.jpg\",\"rating\":7.3,\"year\":2013,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Author P.L. Travers looks back on her childhood while reluctantly meeting with Walt Disney, who seeks to adapt her Mary Poppins books for the big screen.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Drama\",\"History\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":4912,\"title\":\"Confessions of a Dangerous Mind\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mM58ABMRzwn5zVx6BS7IiNK0j3F.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/uS03jRk64ZFFtpKNAhLppXa1nKP.jpg\",\"rating\":6.7,\"year\":2002,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"Television made him famous, but his biggest hits happened off screen. Television producer by day, CIA assassin by night, Chuck Barris was recruited by the CIA at the height of his TV career and trained to become a covert operative. Or so Barris said.\",\"genres\":[\"Comedy\",\"Crime\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null},{\"id\":1026227,\"title\":\"There's Still Tomorrow\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/4Hi7yjiQjokEDStT1MOj5rPgRfW.jpg\",\"backdrop\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/fNXUCk54vGcoKr34olN14ohUSFY.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2023,\"type\":\"movie\",\"overview\":\"In postwar Rome, a working-class woman dreams of a better future for herself and her daughter while facing abuse at the hands of her domineering husband. When a mysterious letter arrives, she discovers the courage to change the circumstances of her life.\",\"genres\":[\"History\",\"Comedy\",\"Drama\"],\"daysUntil\":null}],\"videos\":[{\"key\":\"xzh7HzLXXpk\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"KjOL6n0F0T8\",\"name\":\"Official Teaser\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"}],\"daysUntil\":null}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}